  "id": "JgDNR0tDWj0Z_DVfHB4Fo",
  "name": "WF-02 Stockout Date Calculator",
  "description": "Calculates days-to-stockout and estimated stockout dates for all products. Divides current_stock by avg_daily_sales to project when each product will run out. Called daily by WF-08 Daily Orchestrator.",
  "active": true,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -736,
        -128
      ],
      "id": "5049f667-324b-4dd1-851a-288ed142a605",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Manual entry point for testing.\nUse this to run the stockout calculator independently."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "Products",
        "returnAll": true
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -448,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "665e15e3-0f5a-4613-9643-6c93b222fd36",
      "name": "Fetch All Products",
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "cTHIcrIVh1Uh0w7G",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Retrieves all product rows from the Supabase Products table.\nReturns current_stock, avg_daily_sales, and product_id for each."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst today = new Date();\n\nreturn items.map(item => {\n  const p = item.json;\n  const stock = parseFloat(p.current_stock) || 0;\n  const sales = parseFloat(p.avg_daily_sales);\n\n  let days;\n\n  if (!sales || sales <= 0) {\n    days = 999;\n  } else if (stock === 0) {\n    days = 0;\n  } else {\n    days = Math.floor(stock / sales);\n  }\n\n  const d = new Date(today);\n  d.setDate(today.getDate() + days);\n  const stockoutDate = d.toISOString().split('T')[0];\n\n  console.log(`${p.product_name}: ${stock} units / ${sales} sales = ${days} days`);\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      product_id: p.product_id,\n      days_to_stockout: days,\n      estimated_stockout_date: stockoutDate\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "93a24ea3-d212-4402-a067-e34e5d94cf55",
      "name": "Calculate Stockout Dates",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "JavaScript logic that computes for each product:\n- days_to_stockout = floor(current_stock / avg_daily_sales)\n- estimated_stockout_date = today + days_to_stockout\n\nEdge cases: sales=0 → 999 days, stock=0 → 0 days."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "Products",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "product_id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.product_id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "days_to_stockout",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.days_to_stockout }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "estimated_stockout_date",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.estimated_stockout_date }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -32,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "34d23b12-175c-4a24-bb05-62e6f36877e0",
      "name": "Update Products",
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "cTHIcrIVh1Uh0w7G",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Writes the calculated days_to_stockout and estimated_stockout_date back to each product row in the Products table."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -768,
        64
      ],
      "id": "0f9c4903-d3ed-4c9b-a2a4-9a9cd291623a",
      "name": "When Executed by Another Workflow",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Sub-workflow entry point.\nCalled by WF-08 Daily Orchestrator during the daily pipeline run."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 260,
        "content": "## WF-02: Stockout Date Calculator\n\n**Triggers:** Manual execution or sub-workflow call from WF-08\n\n**Purpose:** Projects when each product will run out of stock based on current inventory levels and average daily sales velocity.\n\n**Calculation:**\n- `days_to_stockout = floor(current_stock / avg_daily_sales)`\n- `estimated_stockout_date = today + days_to_stockout`\n\n**Edge cases:**\n- No sales data (avg=0) → 999 days (safe default)\n- Zero stock → 0 days (immediate stockout)"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -800,
        -400
      ],
      "id": "sticky-wf02-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    }
  ],
